  "question": {
    "text": "Let there be two parabolas <math><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></math> and <math><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>8</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>.</mo></math> Then the locus of the mid-points of the intercepts between the parabolas made on the lines parallel to the common axis is"
